  "infoDialog": {
    "title": "About This Site",
    "description": "This is a completely fan-made passion project — not affiliated with Blizzard Entertainment in any way. It was built just for fun to help the Finnish World of Warcraft community keep track of guild raid progress.",
    "community": "The goal is simple: give Finnish WoW players one place to see how our guilds are doing in current raid content. Whether you're pushing Mythic or just following the race, this site is for you.",
    "noMonetization": "There are no ads, no tracking, no monetization. This project doesn't make any money — it's purely a labor of love for the community.",
    "asIs": "Everything here is provided as-is. Things might break sometimes, data might lag behind, and features come when there's time to build them.",
    "contact": "If something looks wrong, is broken, or you have ideas for improvements — don't hesitate to reach out on Discord! Feedback and suggestions are always welcome.",
    "dataSource": "Data sources: Warcraft Logs, Raider.IO, and Blizzard API",
